cene`\n7. To `EditorNode::_save_scene_silently`\n8. various `_notification` updates\n9. repeat","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959983713/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960271987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107363#issuecomment-2960271987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107363","id":2960271987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wcipz","user":{"login":"geowarin","id":1045636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1045636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin","html_url":"https://github.com/geowarin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T18:45:08Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T18:45:08Z","body":"Bisected to 08343189\n\n```\n08343189dc89678bfbb108c78ae923b66d5949af is the first bad commit\ncommit 08343189dc89678bfbb108c78ae923b66d5949af (HEAD)\nAuthor: daniel080400 <d90027121@gmail.com>\nDate:   Sat May 31 16:57:51 2025 +0800\n\n    Rework scene preview thumbnails\n```","author_associat